**Skar** (/' *skɑɹ̩* /, Scripts) are a race of deer-like humanoids.

# Appearance

# Other Planes

# Powers and Abilities 

## Fey Ancestry
You have advantage on saving throws against being charmed, and magic can’t put you to sleep.

## Tricky Magicians
As tricksters, skar have some spells up their sleeves. You know the dancing lights cantrip. When you reach 3rd level, you can cast the silent image spell once without material components, and need to finish a long rest before you can cast it again. When you reach 5th level, you can also cast the invisibility spell once, without material components, and need to finish a long rest before you can cast it again. Charisma is your spellcasting ability for these spells.

## Thick Hide
You don't need armor since you have naturally thick skin to defend your body. When unarmored, your Armor Class is equal to 11 + your Dexterity modifier. You may use a shield and still gain this benefit.
